    "gamow_factor_derivation": "The integral evaluates to the Gamow factor, G = pi * alpha * Z1 * Z2 * sqrt(2 * mu * c^2 / E), resulting in P ≈ exp(-2 * pi * eta) where eta is the Sommerfeld parameter."
